WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:18.500
I never dreamed before

00:18.500 --> 00:21.340
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.340 --> 00:24.910
into the world of perfect free

00:24.910 --> 00:27.010
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:27.010 --> 00:29.850
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.850 --> 00:32.580
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.580 --> 00:36.150
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.150 --> 00:37.320
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.320 --> 00:40.230
I was made to hit in America

00:40.230 --> 00:43.090
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.090 --> 00:49.000
I was made to hit in America

00:49.000 --> 00:52.670
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.670 --> 00:54.670
(To me, forever)

00:54.670 --> 00:58.380
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.380 --> 01:01.610
(To me, forever)

01:08.450 --> 01:14.060
I was made to hit in America

01:14.060 --> 01:16.900
I was made to hit in America

01:16.900 --> 01:19.760
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.760 --> 01:22.570
I was made to hit in America

01:22.570 --> 01:25.340
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.340 --> 01:33.210
I was made to hit in America

01:44.760 --> 01:45.120
"C-Major Pentatonic Scale"

01:45.120 --> 01:49.960
"C-Major Pentatonic Scale"

01:45.120 --> 01:49.960
It's no good. I can't learn this.

01:49.960 --> 01:51.690
"C-Major Pentatonic Scale"

01:52.800 --> 01:54.900
It's too hard for me.

01:54.900 --> 01:57.670
Fool!

01:57.670 --> 02:02.170
But it's better to learn the scale early.

02:02.170 --> 02:04.200
Fool!

02:07.780 --> 02:11.580
You stupid bird! I'll show you!

02:25.030 --> 02:27.700
Don't rush it, Koyuki-kun.

02:27.700 --> 02:31.160
It's only been two months
since you started playing the guitar.

02:34.570 --> 02:41.980
But he already knows the scale...

02:44.620 --> 02:48.890
C'mon, we need a change of pace.
Let's go swimming!

02:48.890 --> 02:50.250
Huh?!

02:53.830 --> 02:53.960
"Lucille"

02:53.960 --> 02:58.760
"Lucille"

02:53.960 --> 02:58.760
-Okay, here goes!
-Watch the ball!

03:13.040 --> 03:14.840
What?

03:16.950 --> 03:21.250
Umm...So please buy your own melon roll.

03:21.250 --> 03:25.420
It's the truth. I was called
to the faculty office.

03:27.130 --> 03:28.660
S-see you...

03:28.660 --> 03:30.590
Hold it, Tanaka!

03:36.200 --> 03:38.470
Yukio Tanaka of Grade 8B.

03:38.470 --> 03:43.010
Please go to the
faculty office immediately. I repeat...

03:43.010 --> 03:45.240
Listen, Tanaka-kun...

03:45.240 --> 03:49.180
I don't think you're taking your job
as umbrella monitor seriously.

03:49.180 --> 03:51.680
Huh? Oh, no...

03:51.680 --> 03:57.260
Daily life is a series
of little jobs like this.

03:57.260 --> 03:59.850
Maybe I should put this
in your student report...

04:01.790 --> 04:04.800
I'm disappointed in you, Tanaka-kun.

04:04.800 --> 04:06.820
You may go.

04:17.080 --> 04:19.370
Wait, Tanaka-kun!

04:23.510 --> 04:25.240
What is this?!

04:27.220 --> 04:29.090
What happened?!

04:29.090 --> 04:31.350
Oh...It's nothing.

04:35.260 --> 04:39.660
We were kidding around
and Tanabe-kun did a drop kick on me.

04:39.660 --> 04:41.600
Tanaka-kun...

04:41.600 --> 04:45.670
And naturally, I gave it
back to him with a heel hold!

04:45.670 --> 04:47.340
So it's no big deal!

04:47.340 --> 04:49.140
Tanaka-kun...

04:54.010 --> 04:58.000
-Did you catch that game?
-Yeah! That was awesome!

05:05.190 --> 05:08.530
You look glum, Koyuki!

05:08.530 --> 05:10.160
Maho!

05:10.160 --> 05:11.590
Yo!

05:27.910 --> 05:30.620
Maho, you sure eat a lot.

05:30.620 --> 05:32.280
Huh?

05:34.120 --> 05:37.420
Shut up. I'm hungry.

05:37.420 --> 05:38.860
You'll gain weight.

05:40.890 --> 05:43.290
You can have my fries.

05:47.630 --> 05:50.330
Beck's first live performance has been set!

05:51.870 --> 05:56.140
Huh?! R-really?

05:56.140 --> 05:58.770
How long is this going to continue?

06:01.180 --> 06:03.480
I'll talk to him for you.

06:03.480 --> 06:05.180
Okay...

06:15.890 --> 06:18.800
Okay, I'm going on deliveries,

06:18.800 --> 06:23.500
so make up for being late
and work extra hard.

06:23.500 --> 06:24.900
I'm sorry!

06:24.900 --> 06:27.840
And don't forget to feed Page.

06:29.010 --> 06:30.200
I'm off!

06:31.540 --> 06:35.710
-He sure is strict.
-Yeah. Around strangers.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.520
It's okay, I'll feed him.

06:44.520 --> 06:48.030
-He's...
-You little-!

06:48.030 --> 06:50.390
T-this is the last of it!

06:54.430 --> 06:56.990
Oww...

06:59.670 --> 07:05.680
Huh?! What is this?!
These aren't company documents!

07:05.680 --> 07:09.150
They're Saito-san's personal treasure!

07:09.150 --> 07:10.650
Treasure?

07:10.650 --> 07:13.820
I mean, private collection.

07:13.820 --> 07:15.250
Collection?

07:18.360 --> 07:21.090
Koyuki, how long have you
been working here?

07:21.090 --> 07:25.160
-Since the end of summer break.
-What for?

07:25.160 --> 07:28.890
I want to repair the guitar
Ryusuke-kun gave me.

07:30.740 --> 07:33.200
I didn't know...

07:33.200 --> 07:37.730
That's why I don't want to see Ryusuke-kun
until the guitar is fixed.

07:38.880 --> 07:41.210
Right. I understand.

07:43.650 --> 07:45.650
So, how much do you get paid?

07:45.650 --> 07:49.690
Oh, umm...430 yen an hour.

07:49.690 --> 07:52.520
Are you serious?! That's crazy!

07:57.660 --> 08:01.360
This new law sure is bad
for the manufacturing industry.

08:02.670 --> 08:06.330
-Saito-sama, this way please.
-Yes.

08:07.710 --> 08:08.870
Thank you for waiting.

08:08.870 --> 08:11.980
Rie-chan! Thank you for calling her.

08:11.980 --> 08:14.150
-Oh, it's Ken-ken!
-Rie-rie!

08:14.150 --> 08:17.840
-I missed you sooo much!
-Me too!

08:36.430 --> 08:39.240
What's with the get-up?
Caught a cold or something?

08:39.240 --> 08:43.440
I'm in disguise! But how'd
you guess it was me?

08:43.440 --> 08:46.840
You stand out too much.
Okay, it's starting!

08:48.480 --> 08:53.420
Ryusuke-kun's guitar...
Are those bullet marks?!

08:53.420 --> 08:56.520
Yup. They're real.

08:56.520 --> 08:57.660
Is that...

08:57.660 --> 09:00.990
That guitar has a name...
It's Lucille.

09:00.990 --> 09:04.460
-Sounds like a woman's name.
-Yeah...

09:04.460 --> 09:08.170
It's a guitar with a past...
Ryusuke got it in some dangerous place.

09:08.170 --> 09:12.660
But...It couldn't possibly have
happened while he was performing?!

09:25.480 --> 09:27.040
One, two!

09:28.420 --> 09:34.890
Typhoon 24! 24-7! 24 hours straight!

09:34.890 --> 09:37.860
BECK! B-E-C-K!

09:37.860 --> 09:43.030
We're gonna rush at you!
We're gonna send you flyin' head-first!

09:43.030 --> 09:45.140
Lift up your heavy ass, now

09:45.140 --> 09:48.540
If you take off that stiff head
you'll feel totally loose

09:48.540 --> 09:50.110
This crazy, crazy world

09:50.110 --> 09:52.810
You just have to Stage Dive or Die

09:52.810 --> 09:54.850
Mind blower, a shower of sweat

09:54.850 --> 09:57.310
Run towards a new world, my life

09:57.310 --> 09:59.720
Those who seek it will be rewarded

09:59.720 --> 10:02.720
Pass the hot shot,
keep on coming, come on!

10:02.720 --> 10:05.660
Blow your mind

10:05.660 --> 10:08.160
Squeeze your sweat yeah

10:08.160 --> 10:10.460
Blow your mind

10:10.460 --> 10:11.800
Squeeze your sweat

10:11.800 --> 10:14.700
This...is Beck...

10:17.300 --> 10:19.700
Koyuki-kun...

10:19.700 --> 10:22.270
Can you go over to Hayakama Instruments?

10:22.270 --> 10:25.010
Huh?! There's still more?!

10:25.010 --> 10:27.240
-The guitar's fixed now.
-Huh?!

10:27.240 --> 10:32.080
The one with the broken neck.
I sent it out for repairs.

10:36.250 --> 10:39.120
I-is that true?!

10:40.990 --> 10:44.460
You want to patch things up
with Ryusuke, don't you?

10:44.460 --> 10:46.300
Saito-san!

10:46.300 --> 10:49.030
Now go, hurry!

10:49.030 --> 10:50.800
Okay!

10:59.040 --> 11:02.440
Koyuki-kun...Deduction for leaving early.

11:06.020 --> 11:09.350
I think this'll do.

11:09.350 --> 11:12.380
If you notice something
while playing it, just let me know.

11:13.490 --> 11:18.690
Now I can see Ryusuke-kun!

11:22.130 --> 11:24.230
Hey, Tanaka...

11:43.150 --> 11:46.650
Hey, Tanaka. Lemme play that guitar.

11:49.730 --> 11:54.160
Yuck! What an awful sound...
suits you perfectly!

12:10.350 --> 12:14.820
Hey, Masaru. Lemme try.

12:14.820 --> 12:20.550
What? Forget it, Rikiya-kun.
The sound is the pits.

12:44.280 --> 12:46.850
You laughed just now, didn't you?

12:46.850 --> 12:49.650
-Huh?!
-Don't act innocent!

12:49.650 --> 12:52.390
No, I thought that tune
was "Anarchy in Heaven"...

12:52.390 --> 12:55.320
Recently, the Sex Handles-

12:59.800 --> 13:01.490
Damn thing!

13:04.340 --> 13:06.670
Any complaints?

13:06.670 --> 13:10.980
Didn't think so. It was a
piece of junk anyway. Let's go, Masaru!

13:10.980 --> 13:12.210
Yeah.

13:12.210 --> 13:16.410
-Let's go grind someplace.
-How about New Burger?

13:31.330 --> 13:35.130
Oh! Did you get it, Koyuki-kun?

13:35.130 --> 13:36.600
Yeah...

13:39.300 --> 13:42.100
Oh, good!

13:43.310 --> 13:44.910
It's all fixed, then?

13:44.910 --> 13:49.310
Actually, it's been slow
here at Saito Paper Company,

13:49.310 --> 13:52.870
so getting the money
to fix it was a bit hard.

13:53.780 --> 13:57.910
But it was worth it
to see you smiling again!

14:01.530 --> 14:04.900
Saito-san...Thank you!

14:04.900 --> 14:07.020
Oh, you're welcome!

14:35.090 --> 14:39.000
Mom used to say, "From that day on,
Yukio was like someone

14:39.000 --> 14:43.830
possessed by the guitar,
and played it every single day."

14:55.750 --> 14:58.380
You were great at the concert!

14:58.380 --> 14:59.620
Think so?!

14:59.620 --> 15:04.220
I just looove your vocals, Chiba-kun!

15:04.220 --> 15:07.860
We won't miss your next live performance!

15:07.860 --> 15:14.060
Then I'll put you on the guest list!
Give me your names and numbers!

15:14.060 --> 15:17.830
Hey, Ray! I've gotta talk to you!

15:20.340 --> 15:22.670
Huh? What?

15:22.670 --> 15:24.680
What're you mad about all of a sudden?

15:24.680 --> 15:28.350
Wow! Ryusuke-kun, you speak English!

15:28.350 --> 15:29.710
That's so cool!

15:29.710 --> 15:32.280
Yeah. I lived in New York for a long time.

15:32.280 --> 15:35.350
So I'm more used to English than Japanese.

15:35.350 --> 15:37.490
-That's so cool!
-That's so cool!

15:37.490 --> 15:41.460
We've got to go to New York, too!

15:41.460 --> 15:46.230
-Tell us where you used to live!
-Yeah! We wanna visit it!

15:46.230 --> 15:48.630
-Sure.
-Yay!

15:48.630 --> 15:49.430
Those idiots!

15:49.430 --> 15:53.400
I was looking for the ab machine
I bought by mail order last night...

15:53.400 --> 15:56.370
and I finally found it!

15:56.370 --> 15:58.200
Found what?

16:06.950 --> 16:08.580
Look!

16:22.500 --> 16:27.070
This is it...The L48 Eddie gave to you!

16:27.070 --> 16:30.560
Huh? Then the one I gave to Koyuki was...

16:31.740 --> 16:35.870
That was a fake one you got
at the guitar shop in Queens!

16:38.750 --> 16:40.220
Which means...

16:42.620 --> 16:44.590
-Ryusuke-kun!
-Ryusuke-kun!

16:45.460 --> 16:47.750
Don't get tetanus!

16:54.300 --> 16:57.970
Yukio! Telephone!

16:57.970 --> 17:02.030
Yukio! Yukio!

17:09.410 --> 17:11.970
I called Ryusuke too.

17:13.520 --> 17:15.750
You're joking, right?

17:17.550 --> 17:20.390
Oh, speak of the devil.

17:29.830 --> 17:31.230
Sorry!

17:33.570 --> 17:36.810
Maho...Did you really explain it to him?

17:36.810 --> 17:38.570
I did!

17:43.050 --> 17:46.950
Idiot! Why am I running away?!

17:52.220 --> 17:55.020
Oh, Koyuki!

17:56.430 --> 17:58.760
Izumi-chan!

17:58.760 --> 18:05.170
I spoke to Ryusuke-kun on the phone
yesterday and he said to say hi.

18:05.170 --> 18:08.140
Oh...Can you say hello from me, too?

18:09.610 --> 18:13.840
All 9th graders will report
to the gym for curriculum guidance.

18:13.840 --> 18:16.210
I repeat...

18:16.210 --> 18:20.950
-It's almost graduation.
-Yeah...

18:20.950 --> 18:24.150
I'll be lonely.

18:24.150 --> 18:25.680
Really?

18:30.490 --> 18:32.590
See you, Koyuki!

18:50.250 --> 18:51.650
"Dear Koyuki-kun,"

18:51.650 --> 18:55.990
"I've decided to stay here a bit longer,
so please take care of Page!"

18:55.990 --> 18:58.590
He's extending his stay again!

18:58.590 --> 19:03.230
Southeast Asia must have
something that lures grown men...

19:03.230 --> 19:05.160
Fool!

19:08.600 --> 19:10.620
I haven't played yet!

19:12.040 --> 19:15.240
Punk rockers hold their guitars low...

19:15.240 --> 19:16.640
Awright!

19:20.840 --> 19:22.470
Yay!

19:38.460 --> 19:41.120
Cripes! I'd better go to sleep!

20:16.570 --> 20:21.060
"Kugatsu no Umi wa Darui Hito"

20:33.950 --> 20:35.510
Look...

20:37.550 --> 20:39.090
Eiji...

20:39.090 --> 20:41.330
Look at him...

20:41.330 --> 20:45.130
Didn't he make his band successful
all by himself?

20:45.130 --> 20:49.030
We just do things our way.

20:49.030 --> 20:51.030
Umm...Ginger ale.

20:51.030 --> 20:52.330
Okay.

20:53.600 --> 20:57.640
Hey, Koyuki! Why'd you
run away the other day?!

20:57.640 --> 20:58.970
Sorry!

21:16.030 --> 21:17.990
Koyuki! Let's go up front!

21:17.990 --> 21:21.060
Let's go concrete hell,
human safari park escape

21:21.060 --> 21:25.070
Ape in the brain,
mass brain-washing operation,
no thank you

21:25.070 --> 21:26.970
Let's walk together, step in step,
and we'll get stuck in the deep

21:26.970 --> 21:28.240
-I-is this what rap is?

21:26.970 --> 21:28.240
-Let's walk together, step in step,
and we'll get stuck in the deep

21:28.240 --> 21:28.910
-I-is this what rap is?

21:28.240 --> 21:28.910
-We're at the rebellious age,
free as we go

21:28.910 --> 21:31.440
-Huh? You say something?

21:28.910 --> 21:31.440
-We're at the rebellious age,
free as we go

21:31.440 --> 21:36.010
This is no barrier, just what is important,
nothing impure, just clear

21:36.010 --> 21:37.500
No pressure at our pace

21:41.020 --> 21:42.350
Who? Who? Foojin

21:42.350 --> 21:43.990
Takes me cruisin'

21:43.990 --> 21:47.290
Music that cuts through the wind,
free form

21:51.430 --> 21:56.330
Bullet holes in the body...
That's a creepy guitar...

21:56.330 --> 21:59.100
The acoustic pick-up
in the front is broken.

22:01.170 --> 22:03.370
He has a Roger Mayer at his feet.

22:04.570 --> 22:07.700
But...How is he getting such a sound?

22:17.050 --> 22:18.690
Wow! Amazing!

22:18.690 --> 22:23.460
-Hey, look at that poster!
-I'm gonna get a shot of it!

22:26.760 --> 22:29.870
So this is where Ryusuke-kun
grew up! Isn't it cool!

22:29.870 --> 22:31.800
Totally!

22:31.800 --> 22:33.460
Huh?

22:34.870 --> 22:36.740
That dog...

22:50.350 --> 22:52.460
Another minute

22:52.460 --> 22:55.150
Feelin' so fine

22:57.460 --> 22:59.700
You turn the freeze

22:59.700 --> 23:02.430
into warm light

23:04.530 --> 23:08.100
Had a premonition

23:08.100 --> 23:10.810
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.810 --> 23:14.310
My world comin' down

23:14.310 --> 23:17.110
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.880 --> 23:25.050
If you really wanna fly

23:25.050 --> 23:27.820
you gotta let go

23:40.070 --> 23:42.410
Simply the most

23:42.410 --> 23:44.440
big sensation

23:44.440 --> 23:47.240
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.240 --> 23:49.510
She's really pretty

23:49.510 --> 23:51.510
One-eyed vision

23:51.510 --> 23:54.350
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.350 --> 23:57.850
Little sister showed me

23:57.850 --> 24:00.520
Really took me for a ride

24:00.520 --> 24:02.190
My world comin' down

24:02.190 --> 24:05.530
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.530 --> 24:09.560
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:14.000 --> 24:15.040
Cuttlefish...

24:15.040 --> 24:16.270
Grilled matsutake mushrooms...

24:16.270 --> 24:16.610
"Next Episode"

24:16.270 --> 24:16.610
"Broadcast in the School"

24:16.270 --> 24:16.610
Grilled matsutake mushrooms...

24:16.610 --> 24:18.870
"Next Episode"

24:16.610 --> 24:18.870
"Broadcast in the School"

24:16.610 --> 24:18.870
Mackerel...Eggplant, shortcake...

24:18.870 --> 24:20.210
"Next Episode"

24:18.870 --> 24:20.210
"Broadcast in the School"

24:18.870 --> 24:20.210
Eat it all!
